></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A Grim 19th-Century Vision</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a haunting world inspired by gothic horror and religious folklore with a hand-crafted, grim 19th-century aesthetic. Each playthrough is unique, shaped by the people you meet, the horrors you face, and the choices you make.</p>","developers":["Inverge Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268150/e693c3c34f6019b11e19a7346ac39ce60af77171/header.jpg?t=1757539326","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Peregrino\u00ae is a registered trademark of INVERGE STUDIOS S.L.<br />\r\nINVERGE STUDIOS S.L. All other marks and trademarks are the property of their respective owners. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3268150/1824670050/7fd61ccab564a25f8fd701d3cb69bcbb0d6792da/1750886163/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754474461","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3268150/1824670050/7fd61ccab564a25f8fd701d3cb69bcbb0d6792da/1750886163/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754474461","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3268150/1824670050/7fd61ccab564a25f8fd701d3cb69bcbb0d6792da/1750886163/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754474461","id":257139600,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139600/movie480.mp4?t=1754474461","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139600/movie_max.mp4?t=1754474461"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"h